---
import Layout from '../../layouts/Layout.astro';
import { CALENDLY_URL } from '../../consts';
---
<Layout title="Product Demonstrations · LatentSig" description="Explore available product demonstrations and request a walkthrough with LatentSig.">
  <section class="demos-page"><div class="demos-wrap"><p class="eyebrow">PRODUCT DISCOVERY</p><h1>See the ideas in context.</h1><p class="intro">This page separates product concepts from live software. No publicly hosted product demonstration is currently available in this website repository. You can request a walkthrough or discuss a product direction with us.</p><div class="demo-list">
    <article><span class="state">CONCEPT WALKTHROUGH</span><h2>Annotation &amp; Verification</h2><p>A guided discussion around data preparation, annotation decisions, and review steps. The site illustration is not an operational product.</p><a href="/products/annotation-verification/">Explore concept →</a></article>
    <article><span class="state">CONCEPT WALKTHROUGH</span><h2>Agentic AI Platform</h2><p>Discuss a bounded task and map an illustrative request → workflow → result sequence. No working agent runtime is represented here.</p><a href="/products/agentic-ai-platform/">Explore concept →</a></article>
  </div><div class="demo-cta"><div><h2>Have a workflow in mind?</h2><p>Tell us what you want to evaluate and we can discuss a useful next step.</p></div><a href={`${CALENDLY_URL}?utm_source=latentsig_website&utm_campaign=product_demo_page`} target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">Book a Demo ↗</a></div></div></section>
</Layout>
<style>
  .demos-page{min-height:75vh;padding:95px 24px;background:radial-gradient(ellipse at 78% 0,#453b8255,transparent 52%),#0b1020;color:#f4f2ff;font-family:Geist,system-ui,sans-serif}.demos-wrap{max-width:1120px;margin:auto}.eyebrow{color:#c0c1ff;font-size:11px;font-weight:700;letter-spacing:.15em}.demos-page h1{font:600 clamp(2.8rem,6vw,5rem)/1.05 'Hanken Grotesk',sans-serif;letter-spacing:-.04em;margin:18px 0}.intro{max-width:800px;color:#bcbacf;font-size:17px;line-height:1.7}.demo-list{display:grid;grid-template-columns:1fr 1fr;gap:18px;margin:46px 0}.demo-list article{padding:26px;border:1px solid #363a51;border-radius:12px;background:#11182a}.state{color:#dbbd82;font-size:10px;font-weight:700;letter-spacing:.12em}.demo-list h2,.demo-cta h2{font:600 24px 'Hanken Grotesk',sans-serif}.demo-list p,.demo-cta p{color:#b4b2c7;line-height:1.65;font-size:14px}.demo-list a{display:inline-flex;min-height:44px;align-items:center;color:#c0c1ff;text-decoration:none;font-weight:700;font-size:14px}.demo-cta{display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:space-between;gap:24px;padding:26px;border:1px solid #44425f;border-radius:12px;background:#131a30}.demo-cta a{min-height:48px;padding:0 18px;display:flex;align-items:center;border-radius:7px;background:#c0c1ff;color:#17142f;text-decoration:none;font-weight:700;white-space:nowrap}@media(max-width:650px){.demos-page{padding:58px 18px}.demo-list{grid-template-columns:1fr}.demo-cta{align-items:stretch;flex-direction:column}.demo-cta a{justify-content:center}}
</style>
